WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Rep: Let's get specific on the investigation side you mentioned.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Security Analyst: Realistically, each of us spends more than half our shift
chasing down alerts that turn out to be nothing serious. It's exhausting,
and it means the real incidents take longer to get attention.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Rep: What's the loaded cost for an analyst on your team?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:22.000
Security Analyst: Around 128,000 fully loaded, benefits included.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.000
Rep: And headcount — is four still accurate?

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.000
Security Analyst: Actually we just added someone last month, so it's five
of us now, not four.
